      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Pitkin renamed the area “East New York” in the 1830s to market it as a metropolitan rival to New York City.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
