      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Holy Trinity Russian Orthodox Church, founded in 1919, stands at 400 Glenmore Avenue as one of the neighborhood’s oldest landmarks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
